<title>UK: Timah at 15.6225 in London at 0820 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 15.6225 in London at 0820 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $15.6225 per GDR in London on Thursday at around 0820 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $15.6225 and a high of $15.825.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday was $15.8875. One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
